{"sha": "0c1660a6b8d917b03b641f21619f5e8d130263ab07ba91627f35f1b1a554145d", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:functions} 章 --- 标准函数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:functions:1}", "$\\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt 3}{2} = \\frac\\pi3$;", "$\\;\\arccos\\bigl(-\\frac12\\bigr) = \\frac{2\\pi}{3}$;", "$\\;\\arctan(-1) = -\\frac\\pi4$.", "", "$\\arcsin\\bigl(\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\bigr)$: $\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6} =", "\\frac12$，且在 $\\intcc{-\\frac\\pi2}{\\frac\\pi2}$ 内正弦值为", "$\\frac12$ 的角为 $\\frac\\pi6$（而非 $\\frac{5\\pi}{6}$）。", "", "$\\arccos\\bigl(\\cos\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\\bigr)$: $\\cos\\frac{7\\pi}{4} =", "\\frac{\\sqrt 2}{2}$，且在 $\\intcc{0}{\\pi}$ 内余弦值为该数的角", "为 $\\frac\\pi4$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:functions:2}", "$f(x) = \\arcsin(2x - 1)$ 要求 $-1 \\leq 2x - 1 \\leq 1$，即 $x", "\\in \\intcc{0}{1}$。在 $\\intoo{0}{1}$ 上，由链式法则及", "\\cref{prop:b1:functions:arcderiv}可得", "\\[", "f'(x) = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1 - (2x-1)^2}} = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4x - 4x^2}}", "= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x(1 - x)}} .", "\\]", "$g(x) = \\arctan\\sqrt x$ 的定义域为 $x \\geq 0$，且对 $x > 0$ 有：", "\\[", "g'(x) = \\frac{1}{1 + x} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x}", "= \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x\\,(1 + x)} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:functions:3}", "$\\cosh x + \\sinh x = \\frac{\\eu^x + \\eu^{-x}}{2} + \\frac{\\eu^x -", "\\eu^{-x}}{2} = \\eu^x$。由此，对 $n \\in \\Z$ 有：", "\\[", "(\\cosh x + \\sinh x)^n = (\\eu^x)^n = \\eu^{nx}", "= \\cosh nx + \\sinh nx .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:functions:4}", "设 $y = \\arcsin x$，则 $\\cos 2y = 1 - 2\\sin^2 y = 1 - 2x^2$，故", "$\\cos(2\\arcsin x) = 1 - 2x^2$.", "", "设 $y = \\arctan x$，则 $\\sin 2y = 2 \\sin y \\cos y = 2 \\tan y \\cos^2 y =", "\\frac{2\\tan y}{1 + \\tan^2 y}$，故 $\\sin(2\\arctan x) =", "\\dfrac{2x}{1 + x^2}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:functions:5}", "由慢到快：", "\\[", "(\\ln x)^{1000} \\;\\ll\\; x^{100} \\;\\ll\\; x^{\\ln x} \\;\\ll\\;", "\\eu^{\\sqrt x} \\;\\ll\\; \\eu^{x/100} .", "\\]", "理由：$(\\ln x)^{1000}/x^{100} \\to 0$，由", "\\cref{prop:b1:functions:powerrules}（对数增长慢于幂）。", "$x^{100} = \\eu^{100\\ln x}$，且 $x^{\\ln x} = \\eu^{(\\ln x)^2}$：由于", "$(\\ln x)^2 - 100\\ln x \\to +\\infty$，后者占优。$x^{\\ln x} =", "\\eu^{(\\ln x)^2} \\ll \\eu^{\\sqrt x}$ 因为 $(\\ln x)^2/\\sqrt x \\to 0$", "（对数增长慢于幂 $x^{1/4}$，平方后结论依然成立）。最后 $\\sqrt x - x/100", "\\to -\\infty$，故 $\\eu^{\\sqrt x} \\ll \\eu^{x/100}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:functions:6}", "定义域：$x \\neq \\pm 1$，共三个区间。在每个区间上，", "\\[", "f'(x) = \\frac{\\bigl(\\frac{2x}{1-x^2}\\bigr)'}{1 +", "\\frac{4x^2}{(1-x^2)^2}}", "= \\frac{\\frac{2(1-x^2) + 4x^2}{(1-x^2)^2}}", "{\\frac{(1-x^2)^2 + 4x^2}{(1-x^2)^2}}", "= \\frac{2(1 + x^2)}{(1 + x^2)^2} = \\frac{2}{1 + x^2}", "= (2\\arctan x)' .", "\\]", "故 $f(x) - 2\\arctan x$ 在每个区间上为常数。取值：当 $x =", "0$ 时，$f(0) = 0$，常数为 $0$，即在 $\\intoo{-1}{1}$ 上。当 $x \\to", "+\\infty$，$\\frac{2x}{1-x^2} \\to 0^-$，故 $f \\to 0$，而 $2\\arctan x", "\\to \\pi$：常数为 $-\\pi$，即在 $\\intoo{1}{+\\infty}$ 上。由奇函数性质，", "则常数为 $+\\pi$，即在 $\\intoo{-\\infty}{-1}$ 上。综上，$f = 2\\arctan x$ 在", "$\\intoo{-1}{1}$ 上，$f = 2\\arctan x - \\pi$，当 $x > 1$ 时，$f = 2\\arctan x +", "\\pi$，当 $x < -1$ 时。（这正是正切的二倍角公式，", "借 $\\arctan$ 来理解。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:functions:7}", "$\\cosh x = 2$：设 $u = \\eu^x > 0$，则 $u + u^{-1} = 4$，故 $u^2 - 4u +", "1 = 0$，$u = 2 \\pm \\sqrt 3$：$x = \\ln(2 + \\sqrt 3)$ 或 $x = \\ln(2 -", "\\sqrt 3) = -\\ln(2 + \\sqrt 3)$（两解互为相反数，因", "$\\cosh$ 为偶函数，两者均成立）。等价地，$x = \\pm", "\\operatorname{arcosh} 2$.", "", "$5\\cosh x - 4\\sinh x = 3$：代入指数形式的定义，", "$\\frac{5(u + u^{-1}) - 4(u - u^{-1})}{2} = 3$，即 $u + 9u^{-1} =", "6$，亦即 $u^2 - 6u + 9 = (u - 3)^2 = 0$：$u = 3$，唯一解为 $x =", "\\ln 3$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:functions:8}", "设 $\\alpha = \\arctan\\frac12 + \\arctan\\frac13$。由加法公式：", "\\[", "\\tan\\alpha = \\frac{\\frac12 + \\frac13}{1 - \\frac12\\cdot\\frac13}", "= \\frac{5/6}{5/6} = 1 .", "\\]", "两个反正切值均位于 $\\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi4}$ 内（其自变量均在", "$\\intoo{0}{1}$ 内），故 $\\alpha \\in \\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$；该区间内正切值为", "$1$ 的角只有 $\\frac\\pi4$。", "", "马钦公式：设 $\\beta = \\arctan\\frac15$，两次应用二倍角公式：", "\\[", "\\tan 2\\beta = \\frac{2/5}{1 - 1/25} = \\frac{5}{12},", "\\qquad", "\\tan 4\\beta = \\frac{2 \\cdot 5/12}{1 - 25/144} = \\frac{120}{119}.", "\\]", "于是", "\\[", "\\tan\\Bigl(4\\beta - \\frac\\pi4\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{\\frac{120}{119} - 1}{1 + \\frac{120}{119}}", "= \\frac{1/119}{239/119} = \\frac{1}{239}.", "\\]", "范围检验：$\\beta < \\arctan 1 = \\frac\\pi4$，且事实上 $\\tan 4\\beta =", "\\frac{120}{119}$ 接近 $1$，且 $4\\beta \\in \\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$", "（因 $\\beta < \\frac\\pi8$，且 $\\tan\\frac\\pi8 = \\sqrt 2 - 1 > \\frac15$）；", "故 $4\\beta - \\frac\\pi4 \\in \\intoo{-\\frac\\pi4}{\\frac\\pi4}$，在此区间上", "$\\arctan$ 是 $\\tan$ 的逆：$4\\beta - \\frac\\pi4 =", "\\arctan\\frac{1}{239}$，即马钦公式。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}